PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, August to September 2025 ran 45% of normal and October to November 2025 ran 41%. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 46% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1963.</p>"}
